OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club makes history with
OL,4,A#1m lottery win
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter more than 30 years of playing the
OL,7,Flottery, a football club has made
OL,8,Fhistory by winning #1m.
OL,10,FBill Davis, president of Longlevens
OL,11,FAFC, has been entering the same numbers
OL,12,F- each picked by a member 32 years ago
OL,13,F- on behalf of the Gloucester club for
OL,14,Fdecades and was shocked to be told it
OL,15,Fhad won the sum last month.
OL,17,FThe club, which plays in the ninth tier
OL,18,Fof English football, is yet to decide
OL,19,Fwhat to do with its prize, but Davis
OL,20,Fsays the win "secures the future of the
OL,21,Fclub", with the potential to buy its
OL,22,Ffacilities.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
