OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club makes history with
OL,4,A#1m lottery win
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Carter, winners' adviser at the
OL,7,FNational Lottery, said a football club
OL,8,Fwinning "had never happened before",
OL,9,Fdespite 8,000 people becoming lottery
OL,10,Fmillionaires in 32 years.
